  "summary": "The paper presents gate-based quantum circuits for discretized copula sampling, including bivariate B11 copulas with 1-qubit and 2-qubit resolution, trivariate and 4D MB11 constructions, and a VaR estimation example using a B11 copula-based risk model. Reported concrete resources include 5 qubits on IBM Vigo for the 1-qubit B11 experiment, 5 qubits on IBM QX2 for the 2-qubit B11 experiment, and 12 simulated qubits for the VaR/amplitude-estimation example; no practical quantum advantage is demonstrated.",
